<title>USA: FastComm Q3 Feb 1 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>FastComm Q3 Feb 1 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>STERLING, Va. 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	   loss$0.04	   profit $0.02</p>
<p> Net	   loss 445	    profit  206</p>
<p> Revs		 2,358		   3,051</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  FastComm Communications Corp said its net income for the third quarter of 1997 included a one time write down of $75,000, or $0.01 per share, for capitalized research and development related to the acquisition of Comstat Datacom Corp.</p>
<p>Nine month data were not given. The company was not available for comment.</p>
